# Cafe Sales Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project focuses on cleaning and analyzing cafe sales data using Power BI.

**Tool:** Power BI

**Objective:** Prepare the data and build a dashboard to explore sales performance and track key metrics.

## What I Worked On

- Cleaned and prepared the data using Power Query.
- Created interactive charts to explore sales trends and compare products and locations.
- Used KPIs to get an overview of sales performance.
- Worked with DAX measures for key metrics.

## Project Goal

This project is part of my journey in learning Data Analytics and building practical projects to improve my skills.
